"出口 IP / GeoIP 查询访问 Cloudflare Trace、ipinfo.io、ipapi.co 和 ipify；这些服务可看到你的出口 IP。手动 DNS 检查访问 dnsleak.dev，服务可观察到测试查询的解析器地址。STUN 探测访问 Google 与 Cloudflare。" = "Egress IP and GeoIP lookups contact Cloudflare Trace, ipinfo.io, ipapi.co, and ipify; these services can see your egress IP. A manual DNS check contacts dnsleak.dev, which can observe the resolver addresses making the test queries. STUN probes contact Google and Cloudflare.";
