"例如 US、GB、JP。留空时优先参考出口 IP 的地区。" = "Enter a two-letter region code, such as CN, US, GB, or JP. CN means mainland China; HK/MO/TW are shown separately. If blank, checks use agreeing egress geolocation sources. IP geolocation does not establish physical location.";
"预期时区" = "Expected time zone";
"例如 America/Los_Angeles。留空时参考出口 IP 的时区。" = "For example, America/Los_Angeles. If blank, the egress IP time zone is used as a reference.";
"预期系统地区格式" = "Expected locale identifier";
"例如 en_US、ja_JP；留空时可参考出口地区。" = "For example, en_US or ja_JP. If blank, the egress region may be used as a reference.";
"本机代理" = "Local proxy";
"代理客户端" = "Proxy client";
"进程检测只读取本机进程列表。自动识别覆盖常见客户端；无法识别的客户端会显示待配置或警告。" = "Process detection reads only the local process list. Automatic detection covers common clients; unsupported clients are marked for setup or review.";
