"路由测试域名（每行一个）" = "Route test domains (one per line)";
"每次最多检查 20 个域名的 DNS / Fake-IP 表现；不读取代理凭据，也不能确认客户端策略组的最终去向。" = "Each run checks up to 20 domains for DNS / Fake-IP behavior. Proxy credentials are not read, and the final destination selected by client policy groups cannot be confirmed.";
"HTTPS 可达性" = "HTTPS reachability";
"每行填写一个 HTTPS 地址，最多检查 10 个。默认使用 Cloudflare，你可以替换成自己的测试站点。" = "Enter one HTTPS URL per line, up to 10. Cloudflare is used by default; you can replace it with your own test sites.";
"监测" = "Monitoring";
"自动检测间隔" = "Automatic check interval";
"%lld 秒" = "%lld sec";
"默认 60 秒。停止监测或关闭窗口后不会继续在后台运行。" = "The default is 60 seconds. Monitoring stops when you stop it or close the window.";
"网络请求与本地数据" = "Network requests and local data";
"GeoIP 查询：Cloudflare Trace、ipinfo.io、ipapi.co。IPv4 / IPv6 出口：api.ipify.org、api6.ipify.org。手动 DNS 解析器测试使用 dnsleak.dev 的一次性随机主机名；服务可看到出口 IP 和查询其权威服务器的解析器地址。内嵌 WebKit ICE 探测访问 Google 与 Cloudflare STUN，只描述本应用，不代表 Safari 或 Chrome。HK/MO/TW 与中国大陆 CN 分开显示；GeoIP 不能证明物理位置。" = "GeoIP: Cloudflare Trace, ipinfo.io, and ipapi.co. IPv4 and IPv6 egress: api.ipify.org and api6.ipify.org. A manual DNS resolver test uses one-time hostnames from dnsleak.dev; the service can see your egress IP and the resolver addresses that query its authoritative server. The embedded WebKit ICE probe contacts Google and Cloudflare STUN and describes this app only, not Safari or Chrome. HK/MO/TW are displayed separately from mainland CN; GeoIP does not prove physical location.";
"设置保存在当前用户的 macOS 偏好设置中；出口 IP 变化历史只保存在本机 Application Support，保留 48 小时，可在主界面清除。不会上传检测报告。" = "Settings are saved in this macOS user's preferences. Egress IP change history is stored locally in Application Support for 48 hours and can be cleared from the main window. DNS resolver and WebKit probe details are held in memory for the current audit only; audit reports are not uploaded.";
