"设备位置比较需单独点击并授权；只读取一次 macOS 近似位置，坐标仅在本机内存中比对，不会保存或发送给 GeoIP 服务。" = "Device-location comparison requires its own button and your authorization. It reads one approximate macOS location; coordinates are compared in memory on this Mac and are not saved or sent to GeoIP services.";
"位置比较只在手动点击专用按钮并授权后使用 macOS 定位服务；坐标只在本机内存中比较，不会发送给 GeoIP 服务或保存。距离和 IP 位置都是估算值。" = "Location comparison uses macOS Location Services only after you click its dedicated button and authorize access. Coordinates are compared in memory on this Mac, not sent to GeoIP services or saved. Both the distance and IP location are estimates.";
"Mac 销售地区型号" = "Mac sales-region code";
"设备位置与 IP 位置" = "Device location vs. IP location";
"检测到代理进程时计为风险信号，并结合出口与路由判断" = "A detected proxy process is counted as a risk signal and reviewed with egress and routing";
"检测到活动隧道接口时计为风险信号" = "An active tunnel interface is counted as a risk signal";
"比较系统时区与出口 IP 归属地时区" = "Compare the system time zone with the egress IP's mapped time zone";
"比较系统语言地区标记与出口 IP 地区" = "Compare system language region tags with the egress IP region";
"读取 Mac 型号地区代码；只表示销售地区倾向，不代表当前位置" = "Read the Mac model-region code; it indicates a likely sales region, not the current location";
"手动授权后比较设备近似位置与出口 IP 估算位置" = "Compare the device's approximate location with the IP-mapped estimate after manual authorization";
"读取近似位置并比对" = "Compare device location";
"正在获取位置…" = "Getting location…";
"识别出口网络类型、运营商和 ASN" = "Identify the egress network type, ISP, and ASN";
"显示第三方 IP 风险分与代理、托管和滥用标记" = "Show the third-party IP risk score and proxy, hosting, and abuse flags";
"风险等级综合本机检查与第三方 IP 资料，不是通用安全评分，也不预测特定网站的处理结果。未发现风险信号不代表绝对安全。" = "Risk levels combine local checks and third-party IP data. They are not a universal security score or a prediction of how a specific website will treat the connection. The absence of detected signals does not guarantee safety.";
"出口 IP / GeoIP 查询访问 Cloudflare Trace、ipinfo.io、ipapi.co 和 ipify；IP 信誉查询会把取得的公网出口地址（包括可获取的 IPv4 / IPv6）发送给 IPfastcheck。相关服务可看到被查询的出口 IP。IPfastcheck 说明其 IP 记录可保留最长 180 天。手动 DNS 检查访问 dnsleak.dev，服务可观察到测试查询的解析器地址。STUN 探测访问 Google 与 Cloudflare。" = "Egress IP and GeoIP lookups contact Cloudflare Trace, ipinfo.io, ipapi.co, and ipify. IP reputation lookups send the observed public egress addresses, including IPv4 and/or IPv6 when available, to IPfastcheck. These services can see the queried egress IP; IPfastcheck says IP records may be retained for up to 180 days. Manual DNS checks contact dnsleak.dev, which can observe the resolver addresses making test queries. STUN probes contact Google and Cloudflare.";
"发现代理客户端、系统代理或隧道接口时会记录为风险信号；进程检测只读取本机进程，不能单独证明实际流量路径。" = "A detected proxy client, system proxy, or tunnel interface is recorded as a risk signal. Process checks read only local processes and cannot establish the actual traffic path by themselves.";
"GeoIP 查询：Cloudflare Trace、ipinfo.io、ipapi.co。IP 信誉与网络类型查询：IPfastcheck；会提交取得的公网出口地址（包括可获取的 IPv4 / IPv6），服务说明记录最长保留 180 天。IPv4 / IPv6 出口：api.ipify.org、api6.ipify.org。手动 DNS 解析器测试使用 dnsleak.dev 的一次性随机主机名；服务可看到出口 IP 和查询其权威服务器的解析器地址。内嵌 WebKit ICE 探测访问 Google 与 Cloudflare STUN，只描述本应用，不代表 Safari 或 Chrome。HK/MO/TW 与中国大陆 CN 分开显示；GeoIP 不能证明物理位置。" = "GeoIP lookups: Cloudflare Trace, ipinfo.io, and ipapi.co. IP reputation and network type: IPfastcheck; it receives the observed public egress addresses, including IPv4 and/or IPv6 when available, and says records may be retained for up to 180 days. IPv4/IPv6 egress: api.ipify.org and api6.ipify.org. Manual DNS resolver checks use one-time random hostnames from dnsleak.dev; the service can see the egress IP and resolver addresses querying its authoritative server. The embedded WebKit ICE probe contacts Google and Cloudflare STUN and describes this app only, not Safari or Chrome. HK/MO/TW are displayed separately from mainland CN; GeoIP does not prove physical location.";
"IP 信誉分和网络类型来自第三方服务，结果可能不完整或误判；这不是通用安全评分，也不预测特定网站的处理结果。本机规则与第三方结果只保存在当前检测内存中，不上传检测报告。出口 IP 变化历史只保存在本机，保留 48 小时，可在主界面清除。" = "IP reputation scores and network types come from a third-party service and may be incomplete or incorrect. They are not a universal security score or a prediction of how a specific website will treat the connection. Local checks and third-party results remain in memory for the current audit, and reports are not uploaded. Egress IP change history is stored locally for 48 hours and can be cleared from the dashboard.";
